
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Region - Dasrian Valley & Yorenia.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Region - Dasrian Valley & Yorenia.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"oce1ly","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993347907,"size":1529,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"oce1ly"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,17],"#Locations - Region - Dasrian Valley & Yorenia":[19,20],"#Content:":[21,29],"#Content:#{1}":[22,29]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["yorenia","dasrian valley","sawtooth mountain","aspen county"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Dasrian Valley & Yorenia – Lore Summary**  \n- **What:** A rural valley and its hilltop hamlet in Aspen County, Flora. Yorenia is a tradition-bound village, considered provincial by the capital, Tor Veiloth.  \n- **When to select:** When characters visit, reference, or hail from this valley/hamlet; when discussing rural Flora, ancient customs, or local wildlife conflicts.  \n- **Key relationships:** Part of Aspen County (wild, aspen-grove region); shadowed by Sawtooth Mountain. Notable fauna: Desrainian Lionhounds (bred to hate mountain cats) and wild mountain cats. Contrasts with urban capital Tor Veiloth."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Region - Dasrian Valley & Yorenia.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"116r8qh","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/locations/Locations - Region - Dasrian Valley & Yorenia.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,17],"size":810,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
